  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/or-browser-next (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the bun JavaScript runtime from the official oven-sh/bun GitHub release and executes a 727KB heavily-obfuscated payload (math_init.js) at install time. The payload uses a custom string-encoding obfuscation scheme that hides its behaviour from inspection. The package also depends on @onereach/or-file-uploader-next@0.0.7, a sibling package that is itself malicious. A Vue file-browser component has no legitimate reason to download a runtime and run an obfuscated 727KB script during installation.",
